{"title":"Tome Weaponsmithing Titanium","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Thak Footman, Thak Spearman, Ogre Shaman, Ogre Elder, Mountain Ogre +2 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-firespeaker\" title=\"Old Mother Ashka - dropped it in 1 of 33 looted corpses (1/33)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c9d4aa1be4f688f3b580.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Mother Ashka</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/33<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 1 of 33 looted corpses (1/33)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/33<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-spearman\" title=\"Thak Spearman - dropped it in 9 of 495 looted corpses (1/55)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4bb5ae8c7fe265fd4ca.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Spearman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/55<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - dropped it in 17 of 1,183 looted corpses (1/70)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/70<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mountain\" title=\"Mountain Ogre - dr